## A picture file kept beside the note in its folder: `sunset-before-5700.png`.
##
## It is opaque because the maker checks the name: lowercase letters, digits
## and hyphens, then `.png`, `.jpg` or `.svg`, and no folder. So an image is
## always the note's own, never a file elsewhere on the box or a page on the
## web.
ImageFile :: Str.{}
